# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Root .gitignore for the RentCollection monorepo (backend + mobile).
# Each project also has its own .gitignore; this reinforces the rules
# repo-wide and guarantees secrets/build artifacts never get committed.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Secrets — NEVER commit ──────────────────────────────────────
**/appsettings.Production.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/secrets.json
**/*.env
**/.env
# Flutter signing
**/android/key.properties
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
# Real Firebase config (a placeholder google-services.json is committed)
# Uncomment if you replace it with real credentials:
# **/android/app/google-services.json

# ── .NET build artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/publish/
**/.vs/
**/*.user
**/TestResults/

# ── Flutter build artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────
**/build/
**/.dart_tool/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.pub-cache/
**/.pub/

# ── IDE / OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
